# ==============================================================================
# SkillPassport Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================

# Supabase Public API Configuration
# Obtain these from your Supabase project dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# Optional: Set to true if you want to enforce strict network-only Supabase calls
VITE_REQUIRE_REMOTE_SUPABASE=false

# ==============================================================================
# GOOGLE OAUTH 2.0 CONFIGURATION (SERVER-SIDE ONLY IN SUPABASE DASHBOARD)
# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# DO NOT add GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET or SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to this file
# or to Vercel frontend environment variables. All secrets stay in Supabase Dashboard.
#
# To configure Google OAuth 2.0 for SkillPassport:
# 1. In Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials:
#    - Create "OAuth 2.0 Client IDs" (Application type: Web application)
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins:
#        https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co
#        https://your-domain.vercel.app
#        http://localhost:3000
#    - Authorized redirect URIs:
#        https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 2. In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> Google:
#    - Enable Google: ON
#    - Client ID: <Client ID from Google Cloud Console>
#    - Client Secret: <Client Secret from Google Cloud Console>
# 3. In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> URL Configuration:
#    - Site URL: https://your-domain.vercel.app (or http://localhost:3000)
#    - Additional Redirect URLs:
#        https://your-domain.vercel.app/auth/callback
#        https://your-domain.vercel.app/reset-password
#        https://your-domain.vercel.app/dashboard
#        http://localhost:3000/auth/callback
#        http://localhost:3000/reset-password
#        http://localhost:3000/dashboard
#
# ==============================================================================
# GITHUB OAUTH CONFIGURATION (SERVER-SIDE ONLY IN SUPABASE DASHBOARD)
# ==============================================================================
# 1. In GitHub -> Settings -> Developer Settings -> OAuth Apps -> New OAuth App:
#    - Application name: SkillPassport
#    - Homepage URL: https://your-domain.vercel.app (or http://localhost:3000)
#    - Authorization callback URL: https://<your-project-ref>.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
# 2. In Supabase Dashboard -> Authentication -> Providers -> GitHub:
#    - Enable GitHub Provider: ON
#    - Client ID: <Client ID from GitHub OAuth App>
#    - Client Secret: <Client Secret from GitHub OAuth App>
# ==============================================================================
